{"n": 691, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "691.webp", "text": "34-45\n\nABS FAULT 325 IX (ABS Lamp Comes On After Repeated Cancellation By Restarting Engine)\n\nCONDITION (Diagnosed After Engine Stopped)\n\nLamp Immediately after starting engine\n\nLamp 15 to 20 seconds after starting engine\n\n(car stopped, engine running)\n\nLamp at high engine speed In stopped car\n(or long afterrunning ABS contro! after\nStopping car) (> 1 second).\n\nLamp after exceeding speed of about\n12 km/h ((7.5 mph).\n\nLamp about 15 to 20 seconds after moving\noff (road speed > 3 km/h or 1.85 mph).\n\nLamp after moving off frequently\n(road speed > 12 km/h or 7.5 mph).\n\nHydraulic unit, operating voltage,\npower supply.\nAcceleration sender has ground contact.\n\nBreak In “idle boost” current path.\n\nDispersion in sensor leads.\n\nReturn delivery pump, electronics.\n\nBreak In acceleration sender current path.\n\nSensor fault (break in wire).\n\nExcessive voltage fluctuation in speed\nboost activation.\n\nCORRECTION\nService Tester\n\nCheck PIN 16 of ABS wire harness plug for\ngound contact.\n\nBreak In ground connection between ABS wire\nharness plug PIN 3 and solenoid vaive.\n\nCheck electric lead routing of ABS sensors.\n\nService Tester\n\nPin 16 to Pin 1 of ABS wire harness plug or\nconnections 2 and 3 of acceleration sender\n- check plug connection in particular -.\n\nService Tester\n\nDifference in voltage between Pin 3 on ABS\ncontrol unit and Pin 50 on Motronic control\nunit/nominal value: < 0.5 V.\n\nCheck part number of Motronic control unit,\nsee Service Information of Group 34.", "words": [["34-45", 0.4691, 0.0332, 0.5557, 0.057], ["ABS", 0.2432, 0.0975, 0.267, 0.1094], ["FAULT", 0.271, 0.0975, 0.3085, 0.1101], ["325", 0.3126, 0.0981, 0.3313, 0.1101], ["IX", 0.3354, 0.0981, 0.3455, 0.1101], ["(ABS", 0.3495, 0.0981, 0.3779, 0.1127], ["Lamp", 0.382, 0.0988, 0.4124, 0.1134], ["Comes", 0.4159, 0.0981, 0.4539, 0.1107], ["On", 0.4574, 0.0988, 0.4737, 0.1107], ["After", 0.4782, 0.09